    <h1>Brain Puzzle 3 Level 61 Answer: Clean the toilet thoroughly so they can use it successfully.</h1>

    <div class="disclaimer">Unofficial fan-made guide. Not affiliated with the developer of Brain Puzzle 3.</div>
<div class="verify-note">Single-reference steps: this level comes from the all-levels table only. The embedded video is the tiebreaker — if a step does not react, follow the video.</div>
    <div class="answer-box">
      <span class="label">Quick answer</span>
      <p>Level 61 “Can't hold it anymore!”: Clean the toilet thoroughly so they can use it successfully. 14 moves in order (12 drags, 1 swipes). Follow the step cards below or copy the video move-for-move.</p>
    </div>
    <a class="hero-link" href="#video" aria-label="Jump to the level 61 full solution video">
