    </a>
    <h2>Watch the full solution<span class="accent">.</span></h2>
    <p>The video is the fastest way to copy this level move-for-move: some moves are drags, not taps, and text alone cannot show the gesture. Third-party recording, so its level number may differ from yours. Match the scene, not the number.</p>
    <div class="video-wrap" id="video">
      <iframe src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/_DwUr0meNrA" title="Brain Puzzle 3 Level 61 walkthrough video" loading="lazy" allowfullscreen></iframe>
    </div>
    <InContentAd />

    <h2>Level 61 walkthrough: every move in order<span class="accent">.</span></h2>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Steps 1–3</span>
      <strong>Drag the mop (then 2 more)</strong>
      <p>Drag the mop to the boy in the middle. Drag the trash in the cubicle to the trash can. Drag the cigarette pack to the trash can.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Steps 4–6</span>
      <strong>Drag the water bottle (then 2 more)</strong>
      <p>Drag the water bottle from behind to the trash can. Drag the fire extinguisher to the man in the restroom. Drag the fire extinguisher to the fly.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Steps 7–9</span>
      <strong>Drag the plunger (then 2 more)</strong>
      <p>Drag the plunger to the boy in the middle. Swipe right on the window. Drag the spider to the crack in the wall.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Steps 10–12</span>
      <strong>Drag the feces (then 2 more)</strong>
      <p>Drag the feces to the potted plant. Drag the potted plant to the boy. Click the boy's backpack.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Steps 13–14</span>
      <strong>Drag the toothbrush (then 1 more)</strong>
      <p>Drag the toothbrush to the urinal. Drag the garbage bag to the smoking man.</p>
    </div>

    <h2>If your level 61 shows “Corgi Bath”<span class="accent">.</span></h2>
    <p>Brain Puzzle 3 does not hand every player the same scene at the same number: builds and
    install order differ, and both variants are on record. If the banner on your screen reads
    “Everyone's finally here! Come take a nice bath, everyone!”, this is that scene, 13 moves in order:</p>
    <ol class="alt-steps">
        <li>Swipe up the man's clothes.</li>
        <li>Drag the phone to the woman.</li>
        <li>Drag the man's shoes to the corgi.</li>
        <li>Drag the towel from the bathroom to the dusty painting.</li>
        <li>Drag the flute from the painting to the man.</li>
        <li>Double-tap to open the cabinet.</li>
        <li>Drag the book &quot;How to Be a Good Dog&quot; to the Corgi.</li>
        <li>Click Backpack.</li>
        <li>Drag the Poké Ball and hat to the man (drag both items together).</li>
        <li>Drag the phone to the Corgi.</li>
        <li>Drag the dog treats to the woman.</li>
        <li>Drag the dried small fish to the kitten.</li>
        <li>Drag the kitten to the corgi.</li>
    </ol>

    <h2>FAQ<span class="accent">.</span></h2>

    <details><summary>What is the answer to Brain Puzzle 3 Level 61?</summary><p>In order: 1) Drag the mop to the boy in the middle.; 2) Drag the trash in the cubicle to the trash can.; 3) Drag the cigarette pack to the trash can.; 4) Drag the water bottle from behind to the trash can.; 5) Drag the fire extinguisher to the man in the restroom.; 6) Drag the fire extinguisher to the fly.; 7) Drag the plunger to the boy in the middle.; 8) Swipe right on the window.; 9) Drag the spider to the crack in the wall.; 10) Drag the feces to the potted plant.; 11) Drag the potted plant to the boy.; 12) Click the boy's backpack.; 13) Drag the toothbrush to the urinal.; 14) Drag the garbage bag to the smoking man.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Why does nothing happen when I tap in Level 61?</summary><p>Because nothing on this screen answers a plain tap: all 14 moves are 12 drags, 1 swipes. Hold, then drag or swipe exactly as the step card says. In Brain Puzzle 3 a drag that starts on the wrong prop simply snaps back, which looks like a tap doing nothing.</p></details>
    <details><summary>My Level 61 looks different from this page. Why?</summary><p>Brain Puzzle 3 does not show every player the same scene at the same number, and both variants are on record. This page leads with “Can't hold it anymore!”. If your game shows “Corgi Bath” at level 61, use the second walkthrough on this page.</p></details>

